  "document": "Margiana\nMargiana (Greek: \"Margianḗ\", Old Persian: \"Marguš\", Middle Persian: \"Marv\") is a historical region centred on the oasis of Merv and was a minor satrapy within the Achaemenid satrapy of Bactria, and a province within its successors, the Seleucid, Parthian and Sasanian empires."
